flowchart TD
    INET([Internet]) --- ISPA[ISP-A AS64500] & ISPB[ISP-B AS64501]
    ISPA --- EA[EDGE-A] & EB[EDGE-B]
    ISPB --- EA & EB
    EA <--> EB
    EA & EB --- SWOUT[(SW-OUT 901)]
    SWOUT --- FWA[FW-A MASTER] & FWB[FW-B BACKUP]
    FWA <--> FWB
    FWA & FWB --- CA[CORE-A] & CB[CORE-B]
    CA <--> CB
    CA & CB --- LA[LEAF-A1/A2<br/>Hall A] & LB[LEAF-B1/B2<br/>Hall B]
    LA --- CMP[CMP-01/02/03 + STO-01]
    LB --- SRV[BCK + INF + MON + DCIM]
    FWA & FWB --- WEB[SRV-WEB-01 DMZ]
